    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 37 employees and three outside contractors in our business development, sales, customer support and marketing teams.",
        "start_character": 41865,
        "end_character": 42013
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In June 2024, we suspended the development of our 5G broadband product for Fixed Wireless Access applications and reoriented our product roadmap towards low-power 5G variants for IoT, specifically RedCap and eRedCap.",
        "start_character": 6719,
        "end_character": 6935
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to retaining full ownership of 5G intellectual property, we retained the right to sell, support, maintain and enhance our existing 4G product portfolio and develop new generations of chips and modules using such technologies.",
        "start_character": 1732,
        "end_character": 1969
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, once we win a particular design with an end customer, we believe our ability to penetrate other product families at that end customer increases significantly.",
        "start_character": 39421,
        "end_character": 39592
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide our customers with design support, in the form of reference designs that specify recommended methods for interconnecting our chips to surrounding devices, such as host processors, memory and RF front-end components as well as tools to integrate with products from major automatic test equipment vendors.",
        "start_character": 30887,
        "end_character": 31214
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with the sale of 4G intellectual property assets to Qualcomm, we received a license giving us the right to sell, support, maintain and enhance our existing 4G product portfolio and develop new generations of chips and modules using such technologies.",
        "start_character": 46088,
        "end_character": 46352
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our ability to integrate digital and RF functions into a single device also allows us to maintain higher product margins as we believe device manufacturers are willing to pay a premium for our integrated 4G solutions, while also enabling us to reduce our manufacturing costs for wafer fabrication, assembly and testing.",
        "start_character": 22513,
        "end_character": 22832
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Should we decide to broaden our product range by acquiring or developing complementary technologies, we could need additional capital expenditures in order to support development of multi-mode or multi-feature products.",
        "start_character": 3545,
        "end_character": 3764
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since the acquisition of ACP, we also provide RF transceivers for Software Defined Radio applications as well as advanced design services and technology licensing.",
        "start_character": 4006,
        "end_character": 4169
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The transaction included a license back to us of the Monarch2 and Calliope2 IP, which means that we will continue to have the right to manufacture and sell the products to serve our customers as usual, on a royalty-free basis.",
        "start_character": 35272,
        "end_character": 35498
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To further the reach of our sales channels, we are collaborating with microcontroller vendors like Microchip, to develop IoT design kits that provide us the scale of these large corporations and also help their existing end customers easily integrate our products while keeping their software legacy intact.",
        "start_character": 37658,
        "end_character": 37965
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001383395-26-000082",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001383395-26-000082-82380d3f521ac556",
        "accession_number": "0001383395-26-000082",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To support the implementation of this strategy, we operate in partnership with premier Bitcoin financial services platforms and institutional services providers, leveraging their expertise to ensure secure execution, robust governance, and market transparency.",
        "start_character": 10063,
        "end_character": 10323
      }
    ]
  },
